Z||000000||doughboySE||03-19-2000||02:16 PM||||OK SO TODAY I RUN INTO A PROBLEM AGAIN <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>CAR BATTERY WAS DEAD NO BIG DEAL IT HAS DIED OVER THE WINTER A COUPLE TIMES SO I GO TO POP THE TRUNK AND OF COARSE NO POWER TO THE TRUNK SO IT WONT RELEASE,AND OF COARSE THE KEY WONT WORK IN THE TRUNK.<BR>SO NOW THE PROBLEM IS I CANT GET INTO THE TRUNK TO BET TO THE BATTERY TO BOST THE CAR <BR>IS THERE A DIFFERENT WAY TO GET INTO THE TRUNK? AN EMERGENCY SWITCH. OR DO I HAVE TO BUST THE LOCK TO GET IN?<BR>PLEASE HELP I APPRICIATE IT THANX||||reg||1
Z||000001||TOM||03-19-2000||02:23 PM||||Get a cigarette lighter adapter with a long cord. Plug it in and attatch the cord to another battery or car. Light jumper cables. That will give you enough juice to pop the trunk release||||reg||1
